{
  "name": "Ethereal Step",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to step through the Ethereal Plane. As a Bonus Action, you can cast the etherealness spell with this feature, without expending a spell slot, but the spell lasts only 1 minute. During that time, you can use a Bonus Action to switch from the Etheral Plane to back to the Plane you are currently on or vice versa.</p><p>You use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom modifier and you can't use it again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
